"Have the time of your life"

1405
01:23:31,489 --> 01:23:34,666
[PA over loudspeaker] Don't you
see my blood burning with rebellion?

1406
01:23:35,455 --> 01:23:38,308
Don't you hear the roaring of my heart?

1407
01:23:38,918 --> 01:23:41,789
Don't you see the embers
of revolution flare up?

1408
01:23:42,241 --> 01:23:45,457
Don't you hear my voice
cutting through the air?

1409
01:23:45,894 --> 01:23:47,759
What are you still waiting for?

1410
01:23:48,219 --> 01:23:50,357
Why are you holding back?

1411
01:23:50,749 --> 01:23:53,574
Pierce those cloaks of darkness

1412
01:23:53,958 --> 01:23:56,553
Step forward with ferocity

1413
01:23:57,127 --> 01:24:00,039
Break your shackles of submission

1414
01:24:00,442 --> 01:24:03,059
Clench your fist and march ahead

1415
01:24:03,402 --> 01:24:06,175
Come, crush the oppressor’s might

1416
